{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act35side_level_act35side_05_beg",
  "groupId": "act35side",
  "stageId": "act35side_05",
  "title": "文物也上班",
  "storyCode": "AS-5",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act35side/level_act35side_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "999cff30427567ee455a401bde67deb0139b1410d504d2505e6d74f3adffae36",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博物馆广播",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "请排队购票，请排队购票。“与死而复生的沙阿时代将领相会”特别展览正在售票中！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博物馆广播",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "请排队购票，请排队购票......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狂热的观众",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "text": "对，就这样看着我，只看着我，不要看镜头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狂热的观众",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "text": "再稍等一下，我整理一下婚纱！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狂热的观众",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "text": "虽然是连夜赶制出来的，但我以我收藏的三千册沙阿传奇小说担保，它一定符合历史！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "text": "本展览禁止使用闪光灯拍照，以免对文物造成损害，请您注意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狂热的观众",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "text": "来——二十连拍！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "踩着平衡车的观众",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "text": "大家好，现在我终于进入了法尔贾万达巴德博物馆里最神秘的房间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "踩着平衡车的观众",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "text": "接下来我将通过流畅的运镜，三百六十度无死角地记录这位将领的英姿，探索辉煌之城死者复生的奥秘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年幼的观众",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1497_1",
      "text": "爸爸，它的腿里面好像是空的欸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年幼的观众",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1497_1",
      "text": "爸爸你听，敲起来就是空的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "打电话的观众",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "text": "嗯，对，这批货要尽快送到东国，订单不大，重在信誉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博物馆员工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "text": "先生，麻烦管一下您的女儿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "打电话的观众",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "text": "抱歉，等一下，我这边有点事......喂，过来！别乱摸！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博物馆员工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "text": "请不要在博物馆里大声喧哗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "打电话的观众",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "text": "哎，你们自己要搞这种开放式展览，让你们那个展品到处走的嘛！还不限票，自己搞得展馆这么吵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "text": "这是由于，本馆代理馆长阿娜特认为“历史与知识对所有人都是平等的”，不应该设置贵宾票。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "text": "另外，我所处的展台周围高约六十厘米的护栏，本身具有阻拦游客进入的作用。您的孩子越过护栏，将被视为违规行为。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "text": "请配合工作人员......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拿着硬币的游客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_523_1",
      "text": "唉，没投进去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看导览手册的游客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_524_1",
      "text": "手册上没写外国货币有没有用啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看导览手册的游客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_524_1",
      "text": "好吧，手册上根本没写把硬币扔进去就有好运。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拿着硬币的游客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_523_1",
      "text": "试试看，万一呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看导览手册的游客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_524_1",
      "text": "......给我一枚。往它的身体中间投对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博物馆员工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_523_1",
      "text": "请......停手......这是重要的历史文物......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博物馆员工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_523_1",
      "text": "人太多了，根本挤不过去......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_523_1",
      "text": "了解，我会使用武器打开飞来的投掷物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_523_1",
      "text": "（抬手）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "披挂甲胄的观众",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_219",
      "text": "呃啊——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "披挂甲胄的观众",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_219",
      "text": "大家快看这里！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "披挂甲胄的观众",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_219",
      "text": "我扮演的是一千年前的梦魇战士，我被打倒了！这是伟大的历史重现时刻！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_219",
      "text": "我的武器并未触及他的身体。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "披挂甲胄的观众",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_219",
      "text": "噢，沙阿麾下的将领！对你的手下败将说点什么吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_219",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_219",
      "text": "在我生活的时代，各军在斩杀敌方被俘虏的首领示众时，最常说的一句话是“你的内脏会被虫豸吃光”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "披挂甲胄的观众",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_219",
      "text": "好，就这句，再说一遍......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "披挂甲胄的观众",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1490_1",
      "text": "哎哎，你们都别挤过来，我还躺着呢！要发生踩踏事件了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博物馆员工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1490_1",
      "text": "糟了......得赶紧申请人手支援。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博物馆员工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1490_1",
      "text": "这谁能想到......外面还在过漫灌节，怎么会有这么多人跑来看一具会动的古尸啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "身份高贵的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "text": "哈特谢普苏特女士，我听闻这几日您在寻找一颗特殊的宝石。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "身份高贵的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "text": "正好，家族中有颗珍贵非凡的宝石，今天特地带来供您一阅，希望能为您解忧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "text": "真是感激不尽......麻烦给我看一眼吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "身份高贵的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "text": "不知这几日是否有幸邀请您到家中享用晚餐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "text": "很抱歉，女士，我最近真的是忙不过来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "text": "谢谢您特意将这颗宝石带过来，但很可惜，它并不是我要找的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "身份高贵的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "text": "哦，真是遗憾。那就不打扰了，哈特谢普苏特女士，有空再见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "text": "呃......还有多少人等在外面？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "text": "还有七十三位，他们都声称自己手上的宝石可能是你在寻找的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "text": "为什么还有那么多人要见——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "text": "忍忍吧，下午就能休息了，有几位大巴扎的宝石商人说自己找到了一些线索，我们下午去看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "text": "这叫休息吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "text": "当然，下午我们不用见人，光看宝石就够了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "text": "啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宝石商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1495_1",
      "text": "阿娜特女士，这位帕夏之女已经愁眉苦脸地坐在这里三个小时了，剩下的宝石你们还要看吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "text": "还剩下多少颗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宝石商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1495_1",
      "text": "还有两百多颗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "text": "......放在那里吧，我们看完这一箱再说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宝石商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1495_1",
      "text": "那我就先行离开了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "text": "阿娜特......刚刚有人来过吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "text": "他们又送来了一箱宝石。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "text": "阿娜特，不对啊，你的脑袋怎么变成四棱锥体了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "text": "怎么四周的陈设都变成四棱锥了......还亮晶晶的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "text": "佩佩！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "text": "——博物馆终于开门了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "旅馆接待员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1490_1",
      "text": "是啊，阿斯帕齐娅小姐，现在特展一票难求哪！我昨晚就听说了小道消息，想提醒您早早排队去买票，可您昨晚去哪里了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "text": "没关系，特展不是我参观博物馆的重点，还是去拜访那位收藏家更重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "旅馆接待员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1490_1",
      "text": "您看起来心情不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "text": "正如我想的那样，语言是和平的桥梁，沟通是理解的基础，而这座历史古城，也不乏有识之士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "text": "唉，古往今来，以辉煌历史为傲的萨尔贡人啊，他们如果都愿意坐下来和我彻夜倾谈，而不是四处掠夺，那该有多好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "text": "在我的讲解下，那位收藏家明白了米诺斯人的执着，而他对这座城市的介绍也令我受益匪浅......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "text": "......对了，有一件事，我想向你求证。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "text": "在现代的米纳特哈玛仪，银制品是否比金制品更珍贵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "旅馆接待员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1490_1",
      "text": "哈哈，您怎么突然开这种玩笑？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "旅馆接待员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1490_1",
      "text": "当然，这种事情是有的......比如说，被王酋老爷们威胁的时候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "text": "......多谢，情况我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "text": "请问和我同住的那位旅伴回来了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "旅馆接待员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1490_1",
      "text": "回来了，还带着您的另外两位朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "text": "另外两位朋友......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "text": "也好。思想的交流多多益善，我很乐意结识更多像她一样热情豪爽的库兰塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿斯帕齐娅走上旅馆楼梯，在房门前站定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "text": "娜仁图亚，你在吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "text": "我有好消息要告诉你，听完我三个小时的演说，获得第三名的那位收藏家把金杯送给我了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "text": "你想不想和我一起去博物馆看成对的金杯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的声音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "text": "......昨晚我的确没有见到任何人进出那间放着宝石的房间，娜仁图亚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的声音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "text": "我一直躲在对面的屋顶监视，没有闭过眼睛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚的声音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "text": "......你们应该知道这次绑架有多重要。只有这样的目标能让我们马上搞到一大笔钱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿雅妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1485_1",
      "text": "抱歉，娜仁图亚。我们现在立刻去找帕夏之女。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "晚了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "我找来作掩护的商队马上就要出城，现在重新找到她，再计划绑架，得手了也来不及逃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿雅妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1485_1",
      "text": "那......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "说后续的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "你们还是回博物馆，但别再碰那个帕夏之女了，找新的敛财机会，及时向我汇报情况。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "我去找那颗丢了的宝石，至少把它还给阿斯帕齐娅......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "text": "不用还。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿雅吉突然感觉到房间里变得很安静。\n她看了看闯进来的陌生人，又看了看娜仁图亚，最后求助地看向阿雅妮。\n阿雅妮竖起一根手指放在嘴唇前，另一只手摸向腰间的麻醉药。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "呃，听我解释，阿斯帕齐娅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "现在是计划的起步阶段，等计划完成，我一定还上宝石，至少也还上等价的东西。你可以对我更有信心一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "对了，这是我的另外两个手下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "text": "什么计划？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "text": "我听到你们计划用那颗宝石作为诱饵，绑架帕夏之女。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "......你都听到了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "text": "抱歉，我无意偷听，但刚才我就站在门口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "text": "我相信沟通是理解的基础，而且我也知道，你欠了一笔债，现在一定急需用钱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "text": "所以，你想详细讲讲来龙去脉吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "说实话，我对宝石的下落毫无头绪，你就算想帮忙，我也没什么任务可以安排给你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "过去的事情已经过去了，现在的计划......差不多就是没有计划。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "text": "你知道我问的不是这个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "那如果我给你讲了我为什么欠债，想要多大一笔钱，你会支持我的做法吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "text": "我认为我们可以讨论出一种更无愧于良心的做法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "嗯，我还是很了解你的嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "阿斯帕齐娅。能不能麻烦你把手伸出来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "text": "怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "没什么，就是看在我们之间的情分上......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿雅妮和阿雅吉交换了一个眼神。\n她们很清楚，娜仁图亚动手的信号，是清脆的鞋跟叩地声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "——能不能给我欠的账打个折扣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿雅吉&阿雅妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1485_1",
      "text": "......欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "我在你这里借住了半个月，还拿走了一颗宝石，这些都算我欠你的嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "这一袋金币呢，共计一千二百第纳尔，我知道不够还，但......我们的感情就是这么好，对不对？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "text": "娜仁图亚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "对了，里面混了一些外地的铸币，有些商人可能不认，但你总能找到地方花出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "还有一些宝石，虽然都有点小，杂质也有点多，但胜在数量也多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "通融一下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "text": "......娜仁图亚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "text": "你就这么不想跟我谈一谈吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "“沟通是理解的基础”，但我已经理解你了嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "你或许曾在神殿一天又一天地模仿雕像，练习持剑的基本功，或者跟着你的父母，立下一个家族世代传承的誓言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "更重要的是，你是米诺斯英雄万千追随者的其中之一，所以，你想拥有一个纯洁的灵魂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "你一定会伸手去救一个从高楼坠落的人，也一定会狠狠批评一个想要用点......特殊手段的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "text": "是的，你说得对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "text": "我相信人心中有衡量善恶的尺度，律令中亦有尺度。人应该依循尺度行事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "text": "我也同样理解你。或许你会告诉我，王酋帕夏的律令是失常的尺度，你宁可遵从自己的内心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "text": "只是，娜仁图亚......我不敢相信我自己的心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "那要是我哪天被王酋老爷们抓住了，莫名其妙被判了死罪，你会为我惋惜吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "text": "当然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "哈，这就够了。看来你也觉得，如果我死了，对整个萨尔贡都是一大损失。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "要是你愿意加入我的大事业，那我们把事情搞砸死在半路上的几率会小得多。但你不愿意，那也没关系。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "有人会来，有人会走，我当然想吸引大家留在我身边，但要是对离开的人太计较，我岂不是和那些嫉恨我的人一样傻？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "我的意思是——我们都别为难对方了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "text": "......好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "text": "我认为我们债务两清了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "text": "你受伤了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "text": "一点擦伤而已，放心......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "text": "你应该处理一下，我曾见过很多武士疏忽大意，对小伤口置之不理，最后失去生命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "text": "现在已经不是那个时代了......改天我再给你讲讲现代的医疗技术。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "text": "你要休息了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "text": "不......我先修补一下泡水的笔记......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "text": "泡水？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "text": "这是一个很长的故事了，但我不确定自己还有没有精力讲给你听。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "text": "早上分别前，你说会将自己收获的情报分享给我。你做出了承诺，佩佩，你应该告诉我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "text": "......好吧，我今天一无所获。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "text": "我将信息放出去，无数人带着相似的宝石来找我，但没一个扯得上关系。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "text": "一整天，无数颗宝石在我眼前闪来闪去，看得我头晕眼花。随后，我本想点杯饮料歇一会儿，但旁边有两个孩子突然打了起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "text": "桌子倒了，饮料翻了，我擦伤了，笔记本泡水了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "text": "这就是我能分享给你的全部了，祖拜尔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "text": "你能否从中得到自己需要的信息？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "text": "那......你想听听我今天的经历吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "text": "祖拜尔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "text": "来了很多很奇怪的人......不过也很有意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "text": "明天再说吧。你是不需要睡觉，但我真的很累了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "text": "我不想留在展馆内......佩佩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "text": "......再忍受几天吧，我们需要帮助缇缇完成这次特展，毕竟作为交换，她都将宝石给我们了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "text": "等展览结束，我就带你一起去找其他的宝石。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "text": "我也不想去找宝石......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "text": "那怎么行，祖拜尔？作为沙阿宝库的守护者，你不该尽快回忆起全部，重新肩负起自己的职责吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "text": "更着急知晓宝库位置的人不是你吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "text": "啊......是，没错，不然你以为我唤醒你是为了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "text": "佩佩，但我已经苏醒，你不能再将我当作文物来看待，我的行为与想法受我自己控制。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "text": "至少此刻，我并不想那么快回忆起自己的过往。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "text": "明天是个好天气，我想去外面走一走，不想挂念任何事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "text": "要是看到博物馆的展品独自在街上晒太阳，城市里面的人会发疯的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "text": "我说过了，我不是展品！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "text": "抱歉，祖拜尔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "text": "没关系。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "text": "今天已经很晚了，我真的很累，有些事......我们明天再说，好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "text": "晚安。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "空荡的房间里，祖拜尔试着按了一下墙上的开关，关掉了灯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "片刻后，他又试着按了一下，灯重新亮了起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1482_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1482_1",
      "text": "喵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "米奥站在深夜的街道中央，目不转睛地盯着远处那个灯光扑闪扑闪的窗口。\n然后——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "灯光不再闪烁，玻璃碎了一地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "南风过去，那边就是旱季了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "我来得及在那之前搞到足够的钱吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "好，准备跳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "点灯人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1492_1",
      "text": "啊——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "点灯人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1492_1",
      "text": "现在的小姑娘怎么都这么吓人......你这是在干什么？不是要轻生吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "你奇怪什么，这不是本地漫灌节的习俗之一吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "我要找河上的神灵问问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "点灯人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1492_1",
      "text": "那也不是以跳河的方式哇......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "点灯人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1492_1",
      "text": "而且，小姑娘，你从哪堆历史书里翻出来的习俗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "点灯人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1492_1",
      "text": "很久以前人们犹豫不决时，确实会向河流提问，但后来很多问题都可以用钱解决了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "谢谢，不是很有用的生活小诀窍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "点灯人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1492_1",
      "text": "不过，我倒是可以回答你的问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "点灯人举起手中那盏火，凑近娜仁图亚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "点灯人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1492_1",
      "text": "南风吹过之前，你得到的钱不足以填满你自己的欲望，但够用了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "......我换个具体一点的问题。接下来我要去哪里搞这笔钱？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "点灯人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1492_1",
      "text": "黄沙深处。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "萨尔贡可到处都是沙子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "点灯人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1492_1",
      "text": "我只能再回答一个问题了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "我还以为米纳特哈玛仪的人都很阔绰，免费试用品都是无限取用的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "......不，等等，刚刚的不算问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "我想问......那个死脑筋的米诺斯人会来找我吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "点灯人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1492_1",
      "text": "会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "对方的话音刚落，娜仁图亚的余光就瞥到一个影子。\n那个身影在空荡荡的街头驻足，看了她片刻，然后转身走开了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "......阿斯帕齐娅？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "阿斯帕齐娅！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "影子转过街角，赤红的库兰塔追了上去。\n在娜仁图亚耳中，只有风声、河水流淌声，还有逐渐被她抛在身后的点灯人的歌声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "......跟丢了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "我娜仁图亚居然会跟丢目标？真见鬼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "......唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "算了，我又不傻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "这里人人都在祈祷见到什么东西的影子，我刚才又没有听到脚步声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "所以，我是真的见鬼了，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她在街边坐了下来。\n花坛另一侧，同样有人在黑暗中沉默地听着河水流淌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "靠河那边的长椅上经常有水，记得擦擦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "失落的路人？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "失落的路人？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "你不是真的怕鬼吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "怎么，你也看到那个影子，然后害怕了？要我保护你吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "失落的路人？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "......我感到怀念。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "失落的路人？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "虽然没能看清，但我总觉得，那或许是已故亲友的亡魂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "两个人都看到鬼魂，总比一个人见鬼好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "我听说，看到那个身影的人能获得米纳特哈玛仪的祝福，但是坐在这里的人，好像都是倒霉蛋啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "失落的路人？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "......我只是跟人吵架了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "真巧。我想应该是没吵赢吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "失落的路人？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "赢了就不会坐在这里了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "你知道吗？十分钟前还有人告诉我，当地人没什么烦恼，因为钱总能解决烦恼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "我觉得挺有道理的。如果没有和我一样欠着一笔债，你有什么可不快活的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "失落的路人？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "......今天有人扔东西砸我，还有人弄脏了我上周才拿到的新斗篷。我还莫名其妙一天结了二十次婚，男女老少都有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "失落的路人？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "这些事还没人愿意听我说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "哦，哦......那确实挺倒霉的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "你的年龄够了吗？能让他们拿你的个人资料胡乱登记结婚？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "失落的路人？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "......嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "无意冒犯，虽然你声音有点怪，但听起来是个年轻人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "哎，我在你这个年纪的时候，好像运气还挺好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "有一次我们正赶着抢来的驮兽队伍往回走呢，天突然就黑了，头巾都挡不住刮过来的沙子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "还好我们人多，立刻找了一块感觉不太一样的空地开始挖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "你猜我们挖出来什么？两间埋在沙里的屋子，刚好勉强能挤下我们所有人，而且里面有床有桌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "失落的路人？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "......那是古代陵寝的常见陈设。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "哈哈哈，你还挺懂的嘛！我都是过了好几年才知道的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "......那是多好的时光啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "失落的路人？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "是啊......时光能让河流改道，城市建起又消亡。能让骸骨曝露于烈日黄沙，也能让历史越沉越深。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "失落的路人？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "逝去的时日令人怀念，而怀念......令人恐惧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "是啊，逝去的时日再怀念也无法追回。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "失落的路人？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "失落的路人？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "你怀念的那些人，现在怎么样了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "活着，活得很不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "最不好的是，他们都没办法从挫折里走出来往前看了。你都不知道有多少人卖掉了刀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "所以我这个当老大的欠他们一笔债。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "反正，只要攒出一座新的金山，那些傻子肯定就能打起精神，回来过以前那种日子啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "失落的路人？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "......但愿如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "你呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "失落的路人？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "我......我也不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "失落的路人？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "就像人们拼命去追河中神灵的身影，最后看清的却是自己并不想见到的一张脸，这何尝不令人心生恐惧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "如果你依然去追了，那至少说明你也没有那么害怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "好吧，我还没有离开家乡的时候，老妈总在我耳边这么念叨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "所有人都觉得，“梦魇应当是恐惧的主人，从不会被它支配”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "失落的路人？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "——你是梦魇？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "对啊，怎么——"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "娜仁图亚感觉到对方拍了拍她的肩膀，于是她自然地回过头。\n寂静的大街上，只有路灯由远及近一盏一盏点亮。\n哼着歌的点灯人走到他们面前，爬上梯子，打开玻璃灯罩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！！！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "text": "救命，救命啊！我被死人缠上了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
